{"id":"495708","name":"油炸粑粑","author":"阳光吃货爱减肥","authorId":"11960595","desc":"","cover":"images/495708/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"200g"},{"name":"五花肉","amount":"50g"},{"name":"水","amount":"100g"}],"sub":[{"name":"小葱","amount":"两根"},{"name":"酵母粉","amount":"1g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"酵母粉。","img":"images/495708/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加入盐。","img":"images/495708/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放两勺水调匀。","img":"images/495708/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入面粉。","img":"images/495708/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"边加水边用筷子搅拌。成这种形状后就不用再加水了。","img":"images/495708/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"把面揉光滑。","img":"images/495708/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"盖上盖子，让面团发至两倍大。","img":"images/495708/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"面发好了。","img":"images/495708/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"猪肉剁成末，加上葱盐，酱油。","img":"images/495708/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"取一个面团包上肉馅儿。","img":"images/495708/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"大火，开始炸。","img":"images/495708/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"外面脆里面香，非常好吃哦！","img":"images/495708/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"外焦香，内绵软。","img":"images/495708/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"喜欢酥脆的，可以揉稀一点，包的时候手上沾油，用手压的薄薄的，炸出来就酥脆。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}